@camera U10
@anim kahre rise terrace
@wait 2.0
Kahre as "Daro" [laugh]: Finally. Hit harder, I'm old. #line:ch20_kahre_001 #tn:"vowbound.md, verbatim. Kahre speaks as Daro Pemakan, an old smith."
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch20_kahre>>
